{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22582","headline":"早春独游曲江 · 白居易","name":"早春独游曲江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"散职无羁束，羸骖少送迎。\n朝从直城出，春傍曲江行。\n风起池东暖，云开山北晴。\n冰销泉脉动，雪尽草芽生。\n露杏红初坼，烟杨绿未成。\n影迟新度鴈，声涩欲啼莺。\n闲地心俱静，韶光眼共明。\n酒狂怜性逸，药效喜身轻。\n慵慢疎人事，幽栖逐野情。\n回看芸阁笑，不似有浮名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}